  "description": "The Reveal – uncompromising design DNA for long distances. The frameset impresses with great comfort, outstanding power transfer and unbeatable value for money. This model is equipped with the reliable electronic SRAM Rival AXS groupset, a Ritchey road handlebar in combination with the ROSE ALR stem, ROSE R25 wheels and Continental GP 5000 all-round tyres with 30 mm width. More power transfer The impressive BB86 bottom bracket and deep asymmetric chainstays guarantee outstanding power transfer. More comfort Deep seatstays and a full-integrated clamping of the comfortable ROSE D-shape seatpost provide you with various flex-levels and seating positions for more comfort. More integration A fully integrated cable routing solution on the headset gives the cockpit an ultra clean appearance. The Reveal has proven perseverance on the road. An elegant endurance bike for long, comfortable rides. ¹ approx. 8.4 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for frame colour matt radiator grey, size 57 cm, without pedals Slight paint deviations possible on the fork",
